OL,3,GNEWSAOne of Scotland's last D-Day
OL,4,Aveterans dies, aged 100
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe died earlier this week at the
OL,7,FErskine Veterans Charity home in
OL,8,FEdinburgh, where he had been living
OL,9,Fsince the summer.
